/obj/structure/plaque/static_plaque/golden{
	pixel_y = 28;
	name = "SS12's Destruction Memorial Plaque";
	desc = "This is a display to remember Nanotrasen's Space Station 12's rise, as a small research station, and fall as nothing but space debris. Our glorious nuclear operative teams have obliterated said station with help of cyborgs who'd have sacrificed themselves to guarantee certain victory. No matter what, numbers matter. There's a few names of fallen operatives that died for the cause of the destruction on Space Station 12, Agent Kilo, Agent Rover, and Commander Faux."
