	pixel_y = -1;
	desc = "A Nanotrasen Nuclear Authentication Disk, this one is coated in the blood of who you'd assume to be the Captain of who held it as long as they possibly could, but to no avail. It being here only means that they were able to take it with them, it's caked in dust as a reminder that everything must fall someday.";
